          "caption": "Name of QarDedication of Qara Qoyunlu ruler Jahan Shah on the gate of the eastern entrance iwan of Jameh Mosque of Yazd, in 1457a Qoyunlu ruler Jahan Shah on the gate of the eastern entrance iwan of Jameh Mosque of Yazd, in 1457\n\n\n\"9. Dhu’l-Hijjah 861 /October 1457 (p. 126, 3/4). Mosaic faience surrounding the rectangular frame of the doorway of the portal: “. . . the structure of this lofty arch (taf) was restored during the reign of . . . Abu’l-Muzaffar Sultan Jahanshah, Nizam al Dawlah wa’l-Din al-Hajj Qanbar, in Dhu’l-Hijjah 861. Written by Muhammad al-Hakim.” The vault in question is probably the muqarnas of the portal.\" in The Timurid Architecture of Iran and Turan, Vol. 1 (p.416)",
